  "item": [
    {
      "id": "9b6e01b8-9641-439f-8bf3-a7db0d5b9df4",
      "name": "Queries",
      "description": {
        "content": "Queries in Honeycomb are specifications for queries, and are used to identify queries in other parts of the API - in particular: boards, triggers, and query annotations.\n\nThis API allows you to create and get query objects.\n\n## Authorization\n\nThe API key must have the **Manage Queries and Columns** permission. Learn more about [API keys here](https://docs.honeycomb.io/configure/environments/manage-api-keys/).\n",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
      "item": [
